{
  "schema": "narrative.intro_plots/1",
  "_about": "DRAFT, parked (docs/narrative/pending/). Narrative's grammar of implied plotlines (docs/narrative/dynamic-intros.md section 11) in the shape Simulation wrote down (docs/architecture/dynamic-intros.md section 15). The launch pair is filled (ids protagonist and rival); the grammar rows (states, stateRules, types) are for every pair. No spoken lines: only intents, gesture intents and voice tags, since the lines are Orb's, in the voice lab. Keys that start with an underscore are notes. Convention kept by every row: a STATE's gestures sit at look_start and land_first, a TYPE's at land_second and look_end, so a state and a type never name the same fighter at the same point.",
